# APPLE DESIGN & FLUID INTERFACES
When building gesture-driven UI, bottom sheets, or Liquid Glass effects, you MUST follow the guidelines in `.cursor/rules/emil-design-refs/apple-design.md`. Focus on interruptibility, springs over fixed durations, and momentum projection.
